| Introduction to Ledger.com/Start
Ledger.com/Start serves as the official starting point for individuals who want to protect their digital assets using Ledger hardware wallets. As digital currencies continue to grow in popularity, the
importance of secure self-custody has never been greater. This page is designed to help users take their first confident steps with Ledger products while maintaining high security standards and full
‘ownership of their crypto holdings.
Ledger is globally recognized for developing hardware wallets that store private keys offine, significantly reducing exposure to online threats. By visiting Ledger.convStart, users are directed to trusted
resources that help ensure authenticity, prevent phishing risks, and provide clarity during the onboarding process.
| Why Ledger Hardware Wallets Matter
Unlike software wallets or exchange-based storage, Ledger hardware wallets keep sensitive cryptographic keys isolated from internet-connected devices. This approach minimizes the risk of hacks,
‘malware attacks, and unauthorized access. Ledger.com/Start emphasizes the importance of this security model and educates users on maintaining control over their assets,
+ Offine storage of private keys
‘+ Protection against phishing and malware
+ Physical confirmation for transactions
+ Compatibility with multiple cryptocurrencies
‘+ Global rust backed by industry experience
| Getting Started with Ledger Live
Ledger Live is the official application that connects Ledger hardware wallets to a user's desktop or mobile device. Through Ledger.com/Start, users are directed to download Ledger Live directly from
the official source, ensuring authenticity and safety.
Ledger Live allows users to view balances, send and receive assets, install apps for different blockchains, and monitor portfolio performance in one place. It also plays a critical role in device
verification and firmware updates.
Portfolio Overview ‘Track balances and asset value in real time
Asset Management ‘Send, receive, and store cryptocurrencies
‘App Installation ‘Add blockchain apps to your Ledger device
Firmware Updates Keep your device secure and up to date
| Understanding Recovery Phrase Protection
‘One of the most critical elements explained on Ledger.com/Start is the recovery phrase. This phrase is a series of words generated during wallet initialization and acts as the master key to your assets.
